itemGroup.srpwarriorsarmaments.name=SRP: Warrior's Armaments

item.semiorganic_sword.name=§eSemi-Organic Sword
item.semiorganic_sword.desc=§fA weapon made out of Semi-Organic Alloy plated with §eGold§f that exhibits §4anti-COTH§f properties. Capable of efficiently rending parasites.
item.gilded_hive_bane.name=§6Gilded Hive's Bane
item.gilded_hive_bane.desc=§fA §eSemi-Organic blade§f upgraded with technological components to enhance its §4COTH Cell§f §cdestroying§f properties, but requires a §6Module§f to function. Capable of efficiently smiting parasites corresponding to the §6Module§f placed inside. Will only work with simple §6Modules§f.\n§9[Sneak + Use Item] with a Module in your offhand to Activate
item.throngler.name=§bThrong§7mourne
item.throngler.desc=§fA blade completely dedicated to decimating §4The Hive§f, requires a §6Module§f to function. Capable of efficiently §e§lDemolishing§f parasites corresponding to the §6Module§f placed inside. Combined §6Modules§f will affect their respective tiers.\n§9[Sneak + Use Item] with a Module in your offhand to Activate

item.blazesteel_knife.name=§6Blazesteel Knife
item.blazesteel_knife.desc=§fA quick knife made out of §6Blazesteel§f that is certain to disrupt parasitic evolution and regeneration on contact. Each strike has a chance to apply a stack of §6Consecration§f to your foe.
item.blazesteel_cleaver.name=§6Blazesteel Cleaver
item.blazesteel_cleaver.desc=§fA slow, machete-like blade made out of §6Blazesteel§f that explodes on contact with other Blazesteel fragments. Strikes will cleanse §6Consecration§f from your foe, but deal will massive damage depending on stacks removed.
item.blazesteel_multitool.name=§6Blazesteel Multi-tool
item.blazesteel_multitool.desc=§4WIP§f A generalized digging, chopping, and mining tool made out of §6Blazesteel§f that will decimate parasitic blocks.

item.semi_organic_helmet.name=§eSemi-Organic Helmet
item.semi_organic_helmet.desc=§eEach Piece: Grants +1 Level of Divine Protection (Reduces parasite damage to its minimum damage, grants absorption hearts, and loses potency after hit)
item.semi_organic_chestplate.name=§eSemi-Organic Chestplate
item.semi_organic_chestplate.desc=§eEach Piece: Grants +1 Level of Divine Protection (Reduces parasite damage to its minimum damage, grants absorption hearts, and loses potency after hit)
item.semi_organic_leggings.name=§eSemi-Organic Leggings
item.semi_organic_leggings.desc=§eEach Piece: Grants +1 Level of Divine Protection (Reduces parasite damage to its minimum damage, grants absorption hearts, and loses potency after hit)
item.semi_organic_boots.name=§eSemi-Organic Boots
item.semi_organic_boots.desc=§eEach Piece: Grants +1 Level of Divine Protection (Reduces parasite damage to its minimum damage, grants absorption hearts, and loses potency after hit)

item.blazesteel_helmet.name=§6Blazesteel Helmet
item.blazesteel_helmet.desc=§6Each Piece: Counts towards the Paladin Chestplate and Gladiator Chestplate set bonuses
item.blazesteel_paladin_chestplate.name=§6Blazesteel Paladin Chestplate
item.blazesteel_paladin_chestplate.desc=§6Full Set: +10 Max Health\n§6Full Set: Reduces Parasite damage by 60%\n§6Full Set: Immunity to the damage dealing effect of Orbs
item.blazesteel_gladiator_chestplate.name=§6Blazesteel Gladiator Chestplate
item.blazesteel_gladiator_chestplate.desc=§6Full Set: +100% damage dealt as Consecration damage\n§6Full Set: Reduces Parasite damage by 20%\n§6Full Set: Immunity to Slowness\n§6Full Set: Grants stacking Rage the longer you stay inside of an Orb
item.blazesteel_leggings.name=§6Blazesteel Leggings
item.blazesteel_leggings.desc=§6Each Piece: Counts towards the Paladin Chestplate and Gladiator Chestplate set bonuses
item.blazesteel_boots.name=§6Blazesteel Boots
item.blazesteel_boots.desc=§6Each Piece: Counts towards the Paladin Chestplate and Gladiator Chestplate set bonuses

item.blazesteel.name=§6Blazesteel Ingot
item.blazesteel.desc=§7§oAn burning iron alloy infused with the power orb of a §d§oSummoner§7§o or §a§oManducater§7§o. §c§oEXTREMELY toxic §7§oto parasite matter to the point where they will burn excess biomass in an attempt to rid of it. 
item.blazesteel_dormant.name=§6Dormant Blazesteel Ingot
item.blazesteel_dormant.desc=§7§oAn ingot of iron densely compacted with blaze powder that is seemingly waiting a power source. Can be infused with the power orb of a §c§oStrong Parasite§7§o.
item.quench_super.name=§bSuper §6Quench
item.quench_super.desc=§fA more concentrated quench capable of far better purification... if it didn't stick to your hand when you try to throw it.
item.hivesilver.name=§bHive§7silver §fIngot
item.hivesilver.desc=§7§oA brilliant blue and silvery alloy that was empowered and purified from the hive. Dangerously sharp, durable, and seems to weaken parasites on contact...
item.hivesilver_tainted.name=§7Tainted Hivesilver
item.hivesilver_tainted.desc=§7§oAn chunk of mostly silver among other impurities, combined with §e§oGold§7§o, that is still connected to the hive. It may be wise to purify it before use in weaponry.


item.purified_nether_star.name=§bPurified Nether Star
item.purified_nether_star.desc=§fA nether star purified of all evil influences safely contained in reinforced glass. Can be used as a catalyst for specific items.

item.rancid_stomach.name=§bRancid Stomach
item.rancid_stomach.desc=§fThe horrifyingly awful smelling stomach of a §ePure§f Parasite. May contain §7Hive Scrap§f when opened.

effect.divine.name=§eDivine Protection
effect.consecration.name=§6Consecration
effect.judgement.name=§6Judgement
effect.feeble.name=§bFeeble

item.amulet_justice.name=§6Amulet of Justice
item.amulet_justice.desc=§8§oThe scales shift in your favor, your parasitic adversaries' limbs feel heavier and more sluggish when they face you.\n§9Nearby parasites will have slowed movement and attack speed
item.amulet_justice_eye.name=§6Eye of Justice
item.amulet_justice_eye.desc=§8§oThe eye averts your gaze, re-affirming your heroic actions as an enemy of The Source.\n§9Nearby parasites will have greatly reduced attack speed
item.trinket_beckon_permit.name=§aBeckon Farming Permit
item.trinket_beckon_permit.desc=§8§oOne forged signature later and parasites cloned from Beckons and Dispatchers now drop usable components! You have absolutely zero idea how or why this permit even works, but the parasites seem mad about it...\n§9Nearby parasites will be cured of Debar, but will gain Rage III
item.head_mask.name=Face Mask
item.head_mask.desc=§8§oA relic of ancient times, perhaps one of these could work against CotH?\n§9Greatly reduced chance to contract and spread CotH
item.head_glasses_heart.name=Heart Sunglasses
item.head_glasses_heart.desc=§8§oKeeping your spirits up is healthy, these glasses should do the trick.\n§9+25% Max Health
item.head_glasses_truesight.name=Truesight Specs
item.head_glasses_truesight.desc=§8§o\n§9Grants immunity to Distorted Enlightenment and Derived Distortion Phenomenon
item.charm_protection.name=Emblem of Protection
item.charm_protection.desc=§8§oOut of desperation, you reshape some gold and semi-organic alloy into various religious symbols. Maybe, just maybe, one of them can protect you against The Hive.\n§9Grants Divine Protection I and Divine Protection gives more absorption hearts
item.charm_immunity.name=§6Charm of Immunity
item.charm_immunity.desc=§8§oA small stone tablet that protects you against harmful effects\n§9Negative potion effects will wear off twice as fast
item.charm_viral.name=§aCharm of Viral
item.charm_viral.desc=§8§oA small stone tablet that protects you against dangerous parasitic toxins\n§9Viral will wear off thrice as fast and reduces Minimum Damage when hit while under Viral
item.charm_vision.name=§1Charm of Vision Restoration
item.charm_vision.desc=§8§oA small stone tablet that protects you against vision impairing effects\n§9Blindness, Nausea, No Vision, Braining, and Vomit will wear off quatrice as fast 
item.charm_bleed.name=§cCharm of Coagulation
item.charm_bleed.desc=§8§oA small stone tablet that protects you against anti-coagulating attacks\n§9Bleeding will wear off thrice as fast and applies a powerful bleed when hit under Bleeding
item.charm_corrosion.name=§6Charm of Anti-Corrosion
item.charm_corrosion.desc=§8§oA small stone tablet that protects you against armor-melting acids\n§9Corrosion will wear off quatrice as fast
item.belt_module.name=§6Belt of the Horde Menace
item.belt_module.desc=§8§oA belt that protects you when it detects coming in contact with CotH, but requires a module to function\n§9Halves incoming damage from the parasite tier corresponding to the Module placed inside\n§9[Sneak + Use Item] with a Module in your offhand to Activate
item.belt_heavyweight.name=Heavyweight Champion Belt
item.belt_heavyweight.desc=§8§oMaybe if you trick yourself into thinking that you are a professional fighter, you will become one and stand your ground until the very end\n§9Immunity to parasite pulling effects
item.body_plate_regen.name=Plates of Regeneration
item.body_plate_regen.desc=§8§oSome semi-organic armor plates that take advantage of parasites' natural malleability and regeneration by repairing themselves.\n§9Slowly repairs your armor and grants +5 armor
item.body_plate_repair.name=Plates of Automatic Repair
item.body_plate_repair.desc=§8§oSome armor plates that repair themselves and mend your wounds very efficiently, requires Blood as Fuel.\n§9Dealing damage will repair your armor and heal you
item.body_plate_rad.name=Radiation Resistant Plating
item.body_plate_rad.desc=§8§oDerived parasites emit tons of radiation as they attack, these plates should help significantly against their attacks.\n§9Derived parasites deal 80% less damage and min damage to you
item.ring_smite.name=Ring of Smiting
item.ring_smite.desc=§8§oA holy ring that smites your parasitic foes\n§Deals +4 bonus magic damage
item.ring_ash.name=Ring of Ashes
item.ring_ash.desc=§8§oA\n§9
item.ring_consecration.name=Ring of Consecration
item.ring_consecration.desc=§8§oA\n§9

